nts","historical_business_count":8},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Food, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","review_id":"E01iJy4evr1f1Xu6bbjePg","date":"2021-05-17T02:42:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9447418451309204,"text_excerpt":"In love with this place. Nobody in my party drinks alcohol, but the servers were more than happy to serve us our sodas and Shirley Temples both nights we went to Fritzels. The music though. SO GOOD. We sat through multiple sets for each of the four piece bands both nights because the music was wonderful to listen to, and the performers were engaging and having fun. Definitely the best music we heard around New Orleans, and we heard a lot during our trip. The bad stuff- almost zero visible adjustments due to Covid. You are basically sitting in the laps of the other parties at the bar, none of the servers were wearing masks, and very few of the patrons. There was plastic in between the perf..."},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","review_id":"NGJwnvA_yyhQuCrrzUGz2w","date":"2009-03-07T16:11:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9440404176712036,"text_excerpt":"The place is small but yet cozy. This is one of only a few places on Bourbon Street that does not allow \"outside\" drinks inside their place. That is okay. I finished my drink and sat by the bar and ordered another mojito! This is one of the few places that still has live jazz. It was great and due to the place being small, the music sounded even better. I don't quite remember the price of the drinks, but I would say that it was about $8 for the mojito. There is no cover charge but I am pretty sure there is at least a one drink minimum. if you don't drink you can always order an overpriced coke and listened to great jazz! It was a very good experience and I will make sure to come back on m..."},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","review_id":"Wjs8hZss0nxhlGLG7QrsNA","date":"2015-03-16T14:00:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9409921169281006,"text_excerpt":"So while in NOLA and while we were staying in the French quarter I knew that we had to go to a real nice jazz pub and hear some live jazz so I stumbled upon this place. On a Sunday night they had a show at 8pm and the place wasn't huge so we got in like 10 minutes to 8pm to get some good seats. The hostesses were super nice and gave us some front row seats. The entire atmosphere was super fun, it wasn't a huge venue but I liked the small intimacy away from all the crazyness of Bourbon Street. We got our seats and really enjoyed listening to good Jazz music in the heart of NOLA. We listened for about an hour and a half before intermission and really enjoyed it. They have a one drink minimu..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","photo_id":"hM0gKUKTTuyoAfoFKDW0Xg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hM0gKUKTTuyoAfoFKDW0Xg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.914253830909729},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","photo_id":"8FQPDxwfZvcXoz8JMsSliQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8FQPDxwfZvcXoz8JMsSliQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8257961273193359},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","photo_id":"sQcZixgbqR0PVOvyE7PE5Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sQcZixgbqR0PVOvyE7PE5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7891508340835571},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","photo_id":"m4ijdNsEYH8dSDOYKOhqNA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/m4ijdNsEYH8dSDOYKOhqNA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7826752662658691},{"business_id":"snguCYg0ierKRuUTxCDH7w","photo_id":"edxFx6-JMrYFKe-FeZj_Ng","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/edxFx6-JMrYFKe-FeZj_Ng.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.650492250919342}]},"notebook_case":null}
